WEBVTT

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:24.320
I can't believe I have to head
straight to the Kingdom of White.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.690
I don't even get a chance to catch my breath.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:38.030
Still,

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:39.570
the prince is there.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.530
Okay, let's go.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:13.530
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:18.570
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:23.190
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:30.570
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:32.570
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:37.480
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:42.030
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.780
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.400
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:54.150
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.730
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.530
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:04.730
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.780
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.730
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.400
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.980
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:27.000
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:30.000
"Chapter 6"
"The Gray-Green Demoness"

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:02.400
No words can express our gratitude
for fulfilling the terms of our alliance.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:05.690
I only contributed a swing of my sword.

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:09.360
The people of Black suffered heavy losses.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:13.110
Generally speaking, the Kingdom of Black
is home to two peoples:

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.940
Humans and monsters.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:19.320
Monsters are more heavily dependent on darkness.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.820
There is no need for Your Majesty
to concern yourself.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:28.650
Even so, I hear that not all
serve the King of Darkness.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:32.530
I pray that they will be reborn as Pure Soul.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.530
Your Majesty, I don't think...

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.610
Your words are more than we deserve.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:41.070
Even as a citizen of Black,
there can be no greater honor.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.690
Once we return to our country,

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:49.900
I will seek an opportunity to advise our king
to cease his assaults on your land.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:51.940
What?!

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.110
But if you do that, then...!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.940
Thank you for your concern.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.150
However, Knight Commander Phious...

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:04.610
...thanks to you, I have steeled my resolve.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:13.230
It is true that not all we people
of Black wish for war.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.980
And so, if it will help both our kingdoms...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.440
I see.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:26.480
But that would be like offering
your own head on a platter!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.690
Do not worry.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:31.820
I am sure His Majesty will understand.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.230
Adel...

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.900
Excuse me!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.650
A messenger from the Kingdom of Black!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.150
What?

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.860
What shall we do, Your Majesty?

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.480
Show them in.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.690
Yes, Majesty!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.530
I am called Groza.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:03.110
Thank you for pardoning my sudden arrival.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:03.980
Not at all.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.940
Please state your business.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:08.860
I bear a letter from His Majesty.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.570
I hope that you will read it.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:52.190
Your Majesty?

00:05:53.780 --> 00:06:00.400
He requests an extension of the peace until
the damage caused by Bahl has been repaired.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.150
His Majesty does...?

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.440
Yes.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:11.190
It looks like you won't be needing
that resolve for a little while.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.780
Your Majesty?

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.150
I would like...

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.900
...to accept this proposal.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.820
Prepare a reply.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.480
At once, Your Majesty.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.690
I will prepare a room for you.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.860
Please wait a moment.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.440
O-Of course.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:51.820
In the meantime, let me show you all
around the Kingdom of White.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:56.150
Thank you for your personal attention.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:01.230
But, Your Majesty, are you feeling well enough?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.940
I'm much better, thanks to your care.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.440
I see.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:10.360
Besides, I was just thinking that
I could use some fresh air.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:27.110
Phious, Sheama, Your Majesty!

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:28.610
And...

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:33.070
These are our guests from the Kingdom of Black.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:36.150
From Black?!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.440
We're not gonna eat you.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:41.730
Right?

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.820
Right.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:58.610
Huh. I guess not everyone
from Black is a bad guy.

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.110
That's right.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:03.360
So, Theo, what were you doing here?

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.480
Oh!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.400
I was treating this little guy.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.530
Wow.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.230
Theo, when in the world did you learn to...?

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:41.980
I got Sheama to teach me.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.190
Theo has talent.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.900
He might even surpass me one day.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:49.780
What?!

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.940
Weren't you going to join the Knights of Light?

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.820
Well...

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.360
If I did that, you'd end up getting
demoted to vice-commander.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.690
What?!

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:03.980
You can't afford to rest on
your laurels, Knight Commander.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.530
Take care!

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.280
They're awfully well-behaved.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.820
Back in our kingdom...

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:41.650
They get up to all kinds of mischief.

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:44.110
I do think they look cute, though.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:45.320
Yeah.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.280
I'd like to see one.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.070
Hang on, there's nothing cute about them!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.980
They've got mean looks
and they're all dark-looking!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.690
Couldn't the same be said of you, Mr. Envoy?

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.190
He has you there.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.480
You're all dressed in black.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:06.360
Where we come from, this is normal.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:13.110
And look at you--you're wearing
white from head to toe.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.280
I suppose we are.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.730
Your kingdom's fashions are charming.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.570
Yours are lovely, too.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:31.190
They look easy to move in.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.610
Hey, would you let me try some on?

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.480
Huh?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.780
Good idea. That sounds fun.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.940
Sh-Sheama?!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.530
Listen...

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.730
Huh? Hey, what do you mean?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.530
Why us?!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:11:01.030
I see. So, this is a symbol of friendship
between our kingdoms.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.940
It looks great on you, Phious.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.730
Yup.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.320
I-It does?

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.150
Do you want to try?

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.440
No thanks.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.320
Well then, I guess it's our turn.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.570
Yes, let's get to it.

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:27.030
I'll lend you a hand!

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:37.570
Hmm...

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:41.030
Which one of you should I swap outfits with?

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.400
Huh?

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:46.360
Oh!

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.900
It's got to be you!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.940
I...

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.530
Why not?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:04.440
We can't let a messenger from Black
wear Your Majesty's dress,

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.070
but you can still wear hers.

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:09.070
B-But...

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.280
I guess I've got no choice now.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:13.360
Oh!

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.820
Groza?

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.730
Come on, Your Majesty.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.650
H-How do I look?

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.570
Oh my...

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:00.110
It looks <i>great</i> on you.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.320
Does it really?

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:04.150
Thank you very much, Groza.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.150
Don't mention it!

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.570
Now, why don't you show everyone?

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.030
Th-That would be a bit...

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.530
In that case, would you let me try it on next?

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:18.570
All right. I'll change into yours.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.980
I'm sure it will suit you, too, Groza.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.230
I-I'm sure it will.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.480
Oh, here they come at last.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.320
What do you think?

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:56.280
Don't they both look lovely?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.980
Y-Yes! They're quite...

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.280
Yes. I-It suits them both nicely.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:13.820
It's a funny feeling, seeing your
own clothes on someone else.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.320
Yes.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:18.110
Hey, which one's your pick?

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.730
"Pick"?

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.190
I-I think they both look very nice.

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.110
What are you, embarrassed?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.150
Of course not.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:45.030
"No. 06 Star Tanuki"
"One of the most popular species of monster.
Their personalities and level of aggression vary
depending on their environment, so don't put
too much stock in their cute appearance."

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.230
I yield.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.440
But I won't lose next time!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:57.610
I'm shocked the knight commander,
of all people, lost to all of us.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:01.360
Maybe you should take a break.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:04.030
M-Maybe I and--

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:06.940
No! One more game!

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:09.030
Phious,

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.690
the sun will be setting soon.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.030
See the envoys to their rooms.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.820
I-I guess you're right.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:17.400
I think it's fine.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.570
I'm happy.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:25.230
I don't get to spend much time
with all of you like this.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.280
Your Majesty.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.940
That's true.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.570
You can come over to play anytime,
like you used to.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.360
I mean, you're the queen...

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:40.190
It's <i>because</i> she's the queen that she must
stay in the palace and watch her kingdom.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:58.280
Okay then, how about we keep playing
until your knight commander wins?

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.690
Watch your tone, Adel.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.150
Oh, excuse me.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:06.940
I don't mind. There's no need
to stand on ceremony.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:20.030
What, you're hungry, too?

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.530
Yeah.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:24.480
In that case, let's all have dinner together.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.190
Great idea! I was just getting
bored of the palace food.

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.030
A meal in the Kingdom of White...

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.440
I wonder what it will be like.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.980
Sorry to say, this will be
ordinary home cooking.

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.530
Please don't expect too much.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.940
Here you go.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:05.980
Wow.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.110
Wow, it smells delicious.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:15.150
There's more bread, so take as much as you like.

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:17.150
Oh!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:20.070
I brought some food from the Kingdom of Black.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:22.730
Care to try some anchovy?

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.320
What an odd dish.

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.400
I guess I'll try some.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.230
I'd love some.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:44.730
What do you think of our kingdom's home cooking?

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:48.900
It's the same as the palace food: flavorless.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.030
What?

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.860
Don't tell me...

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:55.860
What? It's delicious!

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:59.610
You think so? It definitely needs more salt.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:04.110
True, it is a little plain.

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.110
Would you care to try some of this?

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.320
Oh, I'd love to!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.900
It... doesn't <i>look</i> appetizing.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.070
Still, we won't know unless we eat it.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.610
Let me try some, too!

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:26.780
I see.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:29.150
It's salty.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:32.360
You season your food
more heavily in your kingdom.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.980
It's so salty!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:36.780
Oh, that takes me back.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.400
Not that we've been away all that long.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:42.610
Still, they're so different.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.860
If we want our kingdoms to coexist,

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:50.320
we'll need to understand things
like this about each other, too.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:59.530
What are you doing?

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.780
I'll try that, too.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.530
There's no way they'd be a good match.

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:19.780
W-Wow...

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:22.530
They taste better together.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:26.900
Let's try that, too.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.150
Let's.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.360
Yes.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.320
Me too, me too!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.150
Delicious!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.780
It brings out the flavor.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.610
Yes, it's good.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.820
Sheama, I want some more!

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:50.400
That was great!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.110
I'm amazed they paired so well.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:57.570
Still, we won't be able to taste this again
while we're here, will we?

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:00.030
That was the last of it.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:05.150
Yes, but there's something
even better than that anchovy soup.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.690
What? Really?

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.610
The wild greens Her Majesty picks are better.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:11.940
Huh?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:15.360
Well, they are quite good...

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.730
Wild greens?

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.980
I've eaten wild greens before...

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:31.860
...but I'm sure that your kingdom's greens,
bathed in so much light,

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:35.480
must taste better than any we've eaten.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.980
Let's go.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.900
Huh?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.400
Let's all go pick wild greens!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.530
Groza.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.690
You can't sleep?

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.690
What's wrong?

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:11.940
I'll listen if you'd like.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:18.190
I was just thinking that the Queen of Light
really is an ordinary person.

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:20.320
So are you, Your Highness.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:26.780
I'll stand by you and support you.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:30.730
Someday, when you become king, I'll...

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:33.030
Thank you, Groza.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:44.780
Now, Your Highness, staying up
too late is bad for your health.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.900
We're going to pick
wild greens tomorrow, after all.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.030
Yes.

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.150
I'll go to sleep soon.

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:24.980
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:28.440
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:34.780
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.780 --> 00:22:44.230
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:54.440
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:57.980
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.780
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:07.480
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:10.280
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:18.690
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:22.030
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.860
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:30.190
<i>Through the dark</i>

